{"schema_version":1,"id":"d59f2nlbt6gy","type":"work","title":"哤言","authors":[{"name":"范淶","role":"撰","dynasty":"明","entity_id":"hixhd2h9birh"}],"indexed_by":[{"source":"欽定四庫全書總目","source_bid":"d59dh3vo9af4","title_info":"《哤言》•十卷","author_info":"明範淶撰","summary":"明範淶撰。淶有《兩浙海防類考》，已著錄。是編隨筆劄記，亦語錄之類。前有小引，稱所著筆記二十卷，起辛巳，迄戊申，以年為次。每年有哤言附其後，因錄出別為一冊，凡八卷。其後二卷起己酉，迄癸丑，蓋續所增入也。","edition":"江蘇巡撫采進本"},{"source":"續修四庫全書","source_bid":"d59f2og4vksh","title_info":"《哤言》十卷","author_info":"明范淶撰","summary":"《哤言》十卷。明范淶撰。影印明萬曆刻本。","edition":"影印明萬曆刻本","volume":"第941冊","section":"子部 儒家類"},{"source":"四庫全書存目叢書","source_bid":"d59f2og4vke9","title_info":"《哤言》十卷","author_info":"明范淶撰","summary":"《哤言》十卷。明范淶撰。中國科學院圖書館藏明萬曆刻本。","edition":"中國科學院圖書館藏明萬曆刻本","volume":"第13冊","section":"子部"}],"juan_count":{"number":10},"resources":[{"id":"shidianguji-keben","name":"识典古籍","url":"https://www.shidianguji.com/book/CADAL02054095","metadata":{"edition":"刻本","version":"v3","total_page":365,"paragraph_count":1234,"check_type":"AI整理"},"types":["text","image"]},{"name":"Internet Archive","id":"internet-archive","url":"https://archive.org/details/02091747.cn","types":["image"]},{"id":"wikimedia-commons-xuxiu","name":"維基共享 續修四庫全書 PDF","short_name":"維基共享","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E7%BA%8C%E4%BF%AE%E5%9B%9B%E5%BA%AB%E5%85%A8%E6%9B%B8%E7%AC%AC0941%E5%86%8A.pdf","metadata":{"volume":941},"types":["image"]},{"name":"维基共享资源","type":"image","id":"commons","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%93%A4%E8%A8%80%28%E4%B8%80%29.djvu"}],"measures":[{"unit":"卷","number":10}],"measure_info":"十卷","books":["988g1rel1o"],"updated_at":"2026-08-09T10:41:40+00:00","_has_text":true,"_has_image":true,"period":"ming","period_basis":"據 authors[0].dynasty「明」","dynasty":"明","dynasty_basis":"author_propagation","ai_note":"[ming-round1: author.dynasty 集合=['明'] → dynasty=明]\n\n2026-08-24 J11 description 撮自本條所繫之著錄：本欄之文由撰人、卷數、著錄諸志、志按所稱之佚文出處與輯家、存佚五節綴成，**每節皆據本條 indexed_by 之引文，不出其外，亦不臆造**。凡著錄所無者一字不書。此即 curate-dynasty S3〈借力